NODE id=matrix/bridge.FormatBundle kind=func
  digest=b3:f11bc5d5f306b1fbae66856518ab895818a27c5480930caa5d748a196b8b2b62 file=bridge/bundle.go range=14:75 lang=go exported=true byte_range=257:1931
  sig=func FormatBundle(b *cortex.Bundle) string
  doc=FormatBundle renders a *cortex.Bundle into the canonical text shape\nthat fills `{cortex.bundle}` in MCL prompt interpolation.\n\nThe format is stable, deterministic, and easy for an LLM to parse:\n\n	## Pinned\n	- matrix://cortex/Identity/<ulid>#<v> — <summary>\n	- ...\n\n	## Frame-relevant\n	- ...\n\n	## Outcomes\n	- ...\n\n	## Reachable (lazy)\n	- matrix://cortex/...#<v>\n\n	---\n	form=medium  total_tokens=N  trimmed=N  latency_ms=N\n\nEmpty tiers are omitted. The Reachable section only renders when\nbundle.ReachableURIs is non-empty. Sections are emitted in fixed\norder regardless of caller-requested IncludeTiers so the output\nshape is predictable.\n\nPure function: same Bundle bytes → same string bytes.
EDGES
  calls=matrix/bridge.formOrDefault,matrix/bridge.writeTier
  references=matrix/bridge.b,matrix/bridge.formOrDefault,matrix/bridge.sb,matrix/bridge.u,matrix/bridge.writeTier,matrix/cortex.Bundle
  ^calls=matrix/bridge.Adapter.Context
  ^references=matrix/bridge.Adapter.Context
  ^defines=matrix/bridge/bundle.go

